    assign kicker_en = 'Antared Pro &mdash; venues'
    assign titre_fr = 'Dix minutes dans une salle de pause, sans personne pour expliquer.'
    assign titre_en = 'Ten minutes in a break room, with nobody there to explain.'
    assign intro_fr = 'En entreprise, l&apos;utilisateur n&apos;a re&ccedil;u aucune formation, ne lira pas de notice, et dispose d&apos;un cr&eacute;neau court entre deux r&eacute;unions. La simplicit&eacute; d&apos;usage passe donc avant le nombre de r&eacute;glages, et la question du responsable interne passe avant celle du mod&egrave;le.'
    assign intro_en = 'In a workplace the user has had no training, will not read a manual, and has a short slot between two meetings. Simplicity of use therefore beats the number of settings, and the question of who owns it internally comes before the question of which model.'
    assign pour_qui_fr = 'Pour une entreprise qui installe un &eacute;quipement de pause partag&eacute;, sans personnel d&eacute;di&eacute; pour l&apos;encadrer.'
    assign pour_qui_en = 'For a company installing shared break-room equipment, with no dedicated staff to supervise it.'

