    assign media_hero_brief_en = 'A workplace break room: an Antared DESK panel on a low table, an armchair, plants, daylight through a window wall.'

    assign contraintes_aside_fr = 'Ce segment se joue sur l&apos;appropriation, pas sur la fiche technique : un &eacute;quipement partag&eacute; que personne ne s&apos;approprie finit dans un placard avant la fin du trimestre.'
    assign contraintes_aside_en = 'This segment is decided by adoption, not by the spec sheet: shared equipment nobody owns ends up in a cupboard before the quarter is out.'
    assign contraintes_fr = 'Aucun utilisateur form&eacute;~Un bouton, un minuteur, une consigne affich&eacute;e. Chaque r&eacute;glage suppl&eacute;mentaire est une raison de plus de ne pas s&apos;en servir.|Une salle partag&eacute;e~L&apos;appareil vit dans un lieu commun, donc visible et manipul&eacute; par tous. Il doit se ranger, se nettoyer et supporter d&apos;&ecirc;tre d&eacute;plac&eacute;.|Un cr&eacute;neau court~Dix minutes entre deux r&eacute;unions. Ce qui demande de se d&eacute;shabiller compl&egrave;tement ou de r&eacute;server une salle ne sera pas utilis&eacute;.|Il faut un responsable interne~Quelqu&apos;un qui r&eacute;pond aux questions et remet l&apos;appareil en place. Sans ce r&ocirc;le, l&apos;&eacute;quipement dispara&icirc;t sans que personne ne le d&eacute;cide.'
    assign contraintes_en = 'No trained users~One button, one timer, one posted instruction. Every extra setting is one more reason not to use it.|A shared room~The device lives in a common space, so it is visible and handled by everyone. It has to be stowed, cleaned, and moved without harm.|A short slot~Ten minutes between two meetings. Anything requiring full undressing or booking a room will not be used.|It needs an internal owner~Someone who answers questions and puts the device back. Without that role, the equipment disappears without anyone deciding to remove it.'

