    assign install_texte_en = 'The desk format sits on a low table or a worktop, angled to one side rather than facing the user: the light reaches skin without sitting in the field of view. Ten minutes is enough, and the useful distance is that of a screen &mdash; roughly 40 to 50 cm.'
    assign install_etapes_fr = 'Un poste assis, pas une salle~Un fauteuil dans la salle de pause suffit. Cr&eacute;er une salle d&eacute;di&eacute;e ajoute une r&eacute;servation, donc un obstacle.|De biais, jamais en face~L&apos;appareil n&apos;est pas fait pour &ecirc;tre regard&eacute;. Une orientation lat&eacute;rale r&egrave;gle la question sans consigne suppl&eacute;mentaire.|Une consigne de trois lignes~Dur&eacute;e, distance, peau d&eacute;couverte. Affich&eacute;e en fran&ccedil;ais et en anglais, &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de l&apos;appareil.|Un nom sur le mat&eacute;riel~La personne qui r&eacute;pond aux questions. C&apos;est le point qui d&eacute;cide de l&apos;usage r&eacute;el au bout de trois mois.'
    assign install_etapes_en = 'A seated spot, not a room~An armchair in the break room is enough. A dedicated room adds a booking, and therefore an obstacle.|Angled, never facing~The device is not made to be looked at. A sideways orientation settles that without an extra instruction.|A three-line instruction~Duration, distance, bare skin. Posted in French and English, next to the device.|A name on the equipment~The person who answers questions. That is what decides real usage three months in.'

    assign media_install_brief_fr = 'Vue de trois quarts : panneau DESK allum&eacute; pos&eacute; de biais &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; d&apos;un fauteuil, avant-bras d&eacute;couverts d&apos;une personne assise, salle de pause en arri&egrave;re-plan.'
    assign media_install_brief_en = 'A three-quarter view: a lit DESK panel angled beside an armchair, the bare forearms of a seated person, the break room behind.'

    assign fourniture_fr = 'Les mesures d&apos;irradiance, avec leur distance~Une valeur en mW/cm&sup2; sans distance de mesure ne veut rien dire. Les n&ocirc;tres sont publi&eacute;es sous la forme mW/cm&sup2; &agrave; X cm.|Le spectre, canal par canal~Quelles longueurs d&apos;onde sur quel appareil, et lesquelles se pilotent s&eacute;par&eacute;ment.|La consigne d&apos;affichage et la communication interne~Le texte &agrave; poser &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; de l&apos;appareil et celui &agrave; envoyer aux &eacute;quipes, en fran&ccedil;ais et en anglais, sans promesse que nous ne pourrions pas tenir.'
    assign fourniture_en = 'Irradiance measurements, with their distance~A mW/cm&sup2; figure without a measurement distance means nothing. Ours are published as mW/cm&sup2; at X cm.|The spectrum, channel by channel~Which wavelengths on which device, and which of them are controlled separately.|Wall copy and internal communications~The text to post beside the device and the text to send your teams, in French and English, with no promise we could not keep.'

    assign limites_titre_fr = 'Ce que vous ne pouvez pas &eacute;crire dans une communication interne.'
    assign limites_titre_en = 'What you may not write in an internal communication.'
    assign limites_fr = 'Ce n&apos;est pas de la sant&eacute; au travail~Produits de bien-&ecirc;tre, sans marquage CE de dispositif m&eacute;dical. L&apos;&eacute;quipement ne rel&egrave;ve d&apos;aucun dispositif de pr&eacute;vention r&eacute;glement&eacute;.|Aucune promesse sur la fatigue ou le sommeil~Nous n&apos;&eacute;crivons pas qu&apos;une s&eacute;ance r&eacute;duit la fatigue, am&eacute;liore le sommeil ou la concentration. Ce qui se d&eacute;crit, c&apos;est l&apos;usage.|Aucun suivi individuel~Un &eacute;quipement de pause ne collecte rien et ne se rattache &agrave; aucun dossier. Un usage individuel ne se mesure pas et ne se demande pas.|Aucune &eacute;tude n&apos;a port&eacute; sur nos appareils~Les travaux publi&eacute;s portent sur des longueurs d&apos;onde et des doses, jamais sur un mat&eacute;riel Antared.'
    assign limites_en = 'This is not occupational health~Wellness products, without medical-device CE marking. The equipment is not part of any regulated prevention scheme.|No promise about fatigue or sleep~We do not write that a session reduces fatigue, improves sleep, or sharpens focus. What can be described is the usage.|No individual tracking~Break-room equipment collects nothing and attaches to no record. Individual usage is neither measured nor requested.|No study has been run on our devices~Published work covers wavelengths and doses, never Antared hardware.'

    assign questions_fr = 'Le nombre de personnes sur le site, et le nombre de sites concern&eacute;s.|La salle : pause partag&eacute;e, espace calme, ou salle r&eacute;servable.|La dur&eacute;e du cr&eacute;neau que vos &eacute;quipes peuvent r&eacute;ellement prendre.|Qui portera l&apos;&eacute;quipement en interne.|Votre calendrier, et le cadre budg&eacute;taire dans lequel il s&apos;inscrit.'
    assign questions_en = 'How many people on site, and how many sites are involved.|The room: shared break area, quiet space, or bookable room.|How long a slot your teams can realistically take.|Who will own the equipment internally.|Your timeline, and the budget frame it belongs to.'

    assign media_ask_brief_fr = 'Salle de pause vide, appareil &eacute;teint pos&eacute; sur sa table, consigne affich&eacute;e &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; : l&apos;installation telle qu&apos;elle est le matin.'
    assign media_ask_brief_en = 'An empty break room, device off on its table, the instruction sign beside it: the installation as it looks in the morning.'
  -%}

{%- when 'become-a-dealer' -%}
