    assign contraintes_aside_en = 'What we expect from a dealer comes down to four points, and none of them is negotiated after the first order. Commercial terms are discussed: they are not published on this page because they depend on the market and the volume.'
    assign contraintes_fr = 'Les chiffres se reprennent tels quels~Irradiance, nombre de LED, longueurs d&apos;onde, autonomie : ceux de la fiche fournisseur, avec leur distance de mesure. Un chiffre arrondi vers le haut sur votre site nous engage aussi.|Le cadre l&eacute;gal ne se n&eacute;gocie pas~Produit de bien-&ecirc;tre, sans marquage CE de dispositif m&eacute;dical. Aucune all&eacute;gation de traitement, nulle part, dans aucune langue.|La traduction part de nos textes~Nous fournissons le fran&ccedil;ais et l&apos;anglais. Une autre langue se traduit &agrave; partir de ces textes, pas d&apos;un argumentaire r&eacute;&eacute;crit qui perdrait le cadrage en route.|Le service apr&egrave;s-vente se d&eacute;cide avant~Qui r&eacute;pond &agrave; un client dont l&apos;appareil ne s&apos;allume plus, sous quel d&eacute;lai et dans quelle langue. Cette r&eacute;ponse se donne avant la premi&egrave;re commande.'
    assign contraintes_en = 'The numbers are used as they stand~Irradiance, LED count, wavelengths, battery life: the supplier&apos;s figures, with their measurement distance. A number rounded up on your site commits us too.|The legal frame is not negotiable~A wellness product, without medical-device CE marking. No treatment claim, anywhere, in any language.|Translation starts from our copy~We supply French and English. Another language is translated from those texts, not from a rewritten pitch that would lose the framing on the way.|After-sales is decided first~Who answers a customer whose device no longer switches on, within what delay and in what language. That answer is given before the first order.'

    assign install_kicker_fr = 'Travailler ensemble'
    assign install_kicker_en = 'Working together'
    assign install_titre_fr = 'Ce qui se d&eacute;cide avant la premi&egrave;re commande.'
    assign install_titre_en = 'What gets decided before the first order.'
    assign install_texte_fr = 'Nous pr&eacute;f&eacute;rons un premier &eacute;change pr&eacute;cis &agrave; un dossier g&eacute;n&eacute;rique. March&eacute;, canal de vente, langues, et qui prend en charge le service apr&egrave;s-vente : ces quatre points d&eacute;terminent tout le reste, y compris les conditions commerciales.'
    assign install_texte_en = 'We would rather have one precise conversation than a generic pack. Market, sales channel, languages, and who handles after-sales: those four points determine everything else, commercial terms included.'
    assign install_etapes_fr = 'Le march&eacute; et le canal~Quel pays, et par quel canal : boutique, installation sur site, vente en ligne, ou r&eacute;seau de professionnels.|La gamme port&eacute;e~Toute la gamme ou une partie. Les grands formats et les formats port&eacute;s ne s&apos;adressent pas aux m&ecirc;mes acheteurs.|La documentation~Fiches techniques, mesures d&apos;irradiance, visuels et textes bilingues. Nous les fournissons ; vous les reprenez sans les r&eacute;&eacute;crire.|Le service apr&egrave;s-vente~Qui r&eacute;pond, dans quel d&eacute;lai, et dans quelle langue. C&apos;est le point qui d&eacute;cide de la relation, pas la premi&egrave;re commande.'
    assign install_etapes_en = 'Market and channel~Which country, and through which channel: retail, on-site installation, online sales, or a professional network.|The range carried~All of it or part of it. Large formats and worn formats do not address the same buyers.|The documentation~Technical sheets, irradiance measurements, visuals, and bilingual copy. We supply them; you use them without rewriting.|After-sales~Who answers, within what delay, and in what language. That is what decides the relationship, not the first order.'

    assign media_install_brief_fr = 'Fiche technique imprim&eacute;e pos&eacute;e &agrave; c&ocirc;t&eacute; d&apos;un appareil &eacute;teint, mesures d&apos;irradiance et distances lisibles, plan de travail neutre.'
    assign media_install_brief_en = 'A printed technical sheet beside a switched-off device, irradiance figures and distances legible, on a neutral worktop.'

    assign fourniture_fr = 'Les mesures d&apos;irradiance, avec leur distance~Une valeur en mW/cm&sup2; sans distance de mesure ne veut rien dire. Les n&ocirc;tres sont publi&eacute;es sous la forme mW/cm&sup2; &agrave; X cm, et c&apos;est cette forme qui doit &ecirc;tre reprise.|Le spectre, canal par canal~Quelles longueurs d&apos;onde sur quel appareil, et lesquelles se pilotent s&eacute;par&eacute;ment. La correspondance compl&egrave;te est publique.|Les textes et visuels, en FR et EN~Descriptifs produit, arguments et visuels, d&eacute;j&agrave; &eacute;crits dans le cadre l&eacute;gal du produit de bien-&ecirc;tre.'
    assign fourniture_en = 'Irradiance measurements, with their distance~A mW/cm&sup2; figure without a measurement distance means nothing. Ours are published as mW/cm&sup2; at X cm, and that is the form to reuse.|The spectrum, channel by channel~Which wavelengths on which device, and which of them are controlled separately. The full mapping is public.|Copy and visuals, in FR and EN~Product descriptions, arguments, and imagery, already written inside the legal frame of a wellness product.'

    assign limites_titre_fr = 'Ce que vous ne pouvez pas &eacute;crire sur votre site.'
    assign limites_titre_en = 'What you may not write on your own site.'
    assign limites_fr = 'Aucune all&eacute;gation th&eacute;rapeutique~Ni traitement, ni gu&eacute;rison, ni soulagement d&apos;une pathologie. Cette r&egrave;gle vaut pour la fiche produit comme pour une publicit&eacute; ou un courriel.|Aucun chiffre invent&eacute;~Pas d&apos;irradiance arrondie, pas de LED compt&eacute;es deux fois, pas d&apos;autonomie optimiste. En cas de doute sur une valeur, elle ne se publie pas.|Aucun avis, logo ou certification fabriqu&eacute;~Pas d&apos;&eacute;toiles sans avis r&eacute;els, pas de logo de presse non accord&eacute;, pas de mention &laquo;&nbsp;certifi&eacute; m&eacute;dicalement&nbsp;&raquo;.|Aucune &eacute;tude pr&eacute;sent&eacute;e comme portant sur nos appareils~Les travaux publi&eacute;s portent sur des longueurs d&apos;onde et des doses. Les citer est permis ; laisser croire qu&apos;ils testent un appareil Antared ne l&apos;est pas.'
    assign limites_en = 'No therapeutic claims~No treating, no curing, no relieving of any condition. This holds for the product page as much as for an ad or an email.|No invented numbers~No rounded irradiance, no LEDs counted twice, no optimistic battery life. If a value is in doubt, it is not published.|No fabricated reviews, logos, or certifications~No stars without real reviews, no press logo that was not granted, no &ldquo;medically certified&rdquo; wording.|No study presented as testing our devices~Published work covers wavelengths and doses. Citing it is allowed; implying it tested an Antared device is not.'

    assign questions_fr = 'Votre march&eacute; : pays, langues, et type de client&egrave;le.|Votre canal : boutique, installation sur site, vente en ligne, r&eacute;seau de professionnels.|La gamme que vous souhaitez porter.|Qui assurera le service apr&egrave;s-vente aupr&egrave;s du client final.|Votre calendrier, et le volume que vous envisagez sur une premi&egrave;re p&eacute;riode.'
    assign questions_en = 'Your market: country, languages, and type of customer.|Your channel: retail, on-site installation, online sales, professional network.|The part of the range you want to carry.|Who will handle after-sales with the end customer.|Your timeline, and the volume you have in mind for a first period.'

