    assign contraintes_aside_en = 'The space decides everything: the format, the useful output, the length of a session, and what you can say without stepping outside the legal frame.'
    assign contraintes_fr = 'La surface &agrave; couvrir~Une zone, une articulation ou un corps entier n&apos;appellent ni le m&ecirc;me format ni la m&ecirc;me distance.|La rotation~Le nombre de passages par jour d&eacute;cide du format bien avant l&apos;irradiance.|L&apos;encombrement~Ce qui reste en place et ce qui se range entre deux passages.|Ce que vous afficherez~Le cadre l&eacute;gal du produit de bien-&ecirc;tre s&apos;applique &agrave; tout ce qui porte la marque.'
    assign contraintes_en = 'The surface to cover~One area, one joint, or a whole body call for neither the same format nor the same distance.|Turnover~How many people pass through per day decides the format long before irradiance does.|Footprint~What stays in place and what gets stowed between two sessions.|What you will display~The wellness-product frame applies to everything carrying the brand.'

    assign install_kicker_fr = 'L&apos;installation'
    assign install_kicker_en = 'The setup'
