    assign media_install_brief_en = 'A tight frame on the working distance between a lit device and one area of the body, the distance marker visible.'

    assign fourniture_fr = 'Les mesures d&apos;irradiance, avec leur distance~Une valeur en mW/cm&sup2; sans distance de mesure ne veut rien dire. Les n&ocirc;tres sont publi&eacute;es sous la forme mW/cm&sup2; &agrave; X cm.|Le spectre, canal par canal~Quelles longueurs d&apos;onde sur quel appareil, et lesquelles se pilotent s&eacute;par&eacute;ment.|Des textes bilingues d&eacute;j&agrave; cadr&eacute;s~En fran&ccedil;ais et en anglais, &eacute;crits dans le cadre l&eacute;gal du produit de bien-&ecirc;tre.'
    assign fourniture_en = 'Irradiance measurements, with their distance~A mW/cm&sup2; figure without a measurement distance means nothing. Ours are published as mW/cm&sup2; at X cm.|The spectrum, channel by channel~Which wavelengths on which device, and which of them are controlled separately.|Bilingual copy, already framed~In French and English, written inside the legal frame of a wellness product.'

